OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FScotland can expect heavy rain on
OL,7,FThursday. Turning fresher elsewhere,
OL,8,Fthough still mostly dry, with some
OL,9,Fwarm sunshine. Showery in the north
OL,10,Fthereafter, with dry, warm and sunnier
OL,11,Fweather elsewhere.
